WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.220
Hey, everyone, we've got something a little different for you today.
嘿，大家好，今天我们要给大家带来一些不一样的节目。

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.360
Did you watch The Simpsons?
你看过《辛普森一家》吗？

3
00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:07.240
Do you still watch The Simpsons?
你现在还在看《辛普森一家》吗？

4
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.440
I think we all watch The Simpsons.
我想我们都在看《辛普森一家》吧。

5
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:16.320
Well, after three and a half decades as the voice of Bart Simpson, legendary voice actor
在为巴特·辛普森配音三十五年半之后，传奇配音演员

6
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:21.600
Nancy Cartwright is cracking open the vault on the world's most iconic animated series
南希·卡特赖特将为我们揭开这部全球最具标志性的动画系列的幕后秘辛，

7
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.240
with her new podcast, Simpsons Declassified.
通过她的新播客《辛普森一家解密》。

8
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:29.360
You know we love a podcast that gives you a behind-the-scenes look at your favorite
你知道我们很喜欢那种能带你深入了解你最喜爱节目的幕后播客，

9
00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:32.920
shows, and Nancy and her co-host Sophie do just that.
而南希和她的联合主持人苏菲正是这样做的。

10
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:38.400
They are joined by cast members, writers, directors, celebrity superfans, and they dive
她们邀请了剧组成员、编剧、导演和名人超级粉丝，深入探讨

11
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.440
into the wildest predictions, the forgotten episodes, and fan conspiracies.
那些最疯狂的预言、被遗忘的剧集以及粉丝们的阴谋论。

12
00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:47.880
Simpsons Declassified takes you where no fan has ever gone before.
《辛普森一家解密》将带你前往粉丝们从未涉足的领域。

13
00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.200
And I mean, there's over 800 episodes.
毕竟，这可是有八百多集的内容。

14
00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:51.800
There's lots to discuss.
有太多东西可以讨论了。

15
00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:57.820
Follow and listen to Simpsons Declassified with Nancy Cartwright wherever you get your podcast,
请在各大播客平台关注并收听南希·卡特赖特的《辛普森一家解密》，

16
00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:01.260
and stay right here for a sneak peek from Nancy herself.
接下来请留在这里，欣赏南希本人带来的抢先看片段。

17
00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:02.360
Take a listen.
听听看。

18
00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:04.400
Hi, I'm Nancy Cartwright.
大家好，我是南希·卡特赖特。

19
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:10.160
For over 35 years, The Simpsons has defied time, trends, and even logic.
三十五年来，《辛普森一家》挑战了时间、潮流，甚至逻辑。

20
00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:14.980
But what really happens behind the scenes of the longest-running sitcom in history?
但这部史上最长寿的情景喜剧背后究竟发生了什么？

21
00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:19.440
On Simpsons Declassified, we pull back the curtain like never before.
在《辛普森一家解密》中，我们将以前所未有的方式揭开幕布。

22
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:24.500
Have you ever wondered how The Simpsons regularly predicts future events?
你有没有想过《辛普森一家》是如何经常预言未来事件的？

23
00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:28.720
The craziest one is the theory that we knew 9-11 was coming.
最疯狂的一个理论就是我们预知了9·11事件。

24
00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:35.060
Or how we consistently maintain a world that provides near-limitless opportunities to deep-dive
或者我们是如何始终维持这样一个世界，为深入挖掘

25
00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:37.580
into the inner lives of fictional characters.
虚构角色的内心世界提供了近乎无限的机会。

26
00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:39.920
Who better to ask than the show's creators?
还有谁比剧集的创作者更适合回答这些问题呢？

27
00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.800
We have never run anything.
我们从来没管理过任何东西。

28
00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.120
I do have my curtain right here.
我这儿正好有块幕布。

29
00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:45.040
Should I whip it out?
要我把它拿出来吗？

30
00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.320
The celebrity guests, unless they're Conan.
那些名人嘉宾，除非是柯南。

31
00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.280
I'm sure Conan must have been amazing.
我相信柯南的表现一定很棒。

32
00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:55.960
Join me and my bestie, Sophie Kurtz, every week on Simpsons Declassified.
每周请加入我和我的闺蜜苏菲·库尔茨，收听《辛普森一家解密》。

33
00:01:56.340 --> 00:02:00.260
To journey into mystery, hear all the declassified insiders.
一起踏上神秘之旅，聆听所有解密的内幕消息。

34
00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:04.340
So I had to take my second choice job, which was The Simpsons.
所以我不得不选择了我的第二志愿工作，那就是《辛普森一家》。

35
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:08.420
Play games with us and explore hot takes from you, the fans.
和我们一起玩游戏，探讨你们这些粉丝的热门观点。

36
00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:10.420
It's a volume business, this prediction.
这可是个量大管饱的预言生意。

37
00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:16.000
Be sure to follow and listen to Simpsons Declassified with me, Nancy Cartwright,
一定要记得关注并收听我和南希·卡特赖特的《辛普森一家解密》，

38
00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:17.840
and wherever you get your podcasts.
在各大播客平台均可收听。
